B Function: find_routes
  Categories :
  1 town_a
    * length 0
    * length 1
    * length 2
    * length 3 or more
  2 town_b
    * length 0
    * length 1
    * length 2
    * length 3 or more
  3 exist_a
    * exists         [property a_exist]
    * no_exist
  4 exist_b
    * exists         [property b_exist]
    * no_exist
  5 exist_route_ab
    * no_exist             [if (a_exist) and (b_exist)] [property no_route]
    * direct route exists   [if (a_exist) and (b_exist)]
    * indirect route exists [if (a_exist) and (b_exist)]
  6 multi_min_route
    * one route             [if ((a_exist) and (b_exist)) and not(no_route)]
    * more than one route   [if ((a_exist) and (b_exist)) and (not(no_route) and not(one_route))]
  7 multi_diff_route
    * only one route exists        [if ((a_exist) and (b_exist)) and not(no_route)] [property one_route]
    * many different length routes [if ((a_exist) and (b_exist)) and not(no_route)]
EndFunction;
